1
00:00:04,092 --> 00:00:22,715
Trust and Betrayal: Fake the backstab – not the friendship! Price: your soul. Trust me, bro. Uncle FrizzleBob needs a partner tonight. You. Grab a card and sing along – karaoke for backstabbers. Kayfabe: your best friend holds the chair.

2
00:00:23,495 --> 00:00:28,490
Tag team, partner: Inevitable Mutual Betrayal, reveal hands, lowest loses everything; why are you surprised?

3
00:00:28,849 --> 00:00:32,845
In the Back, Steal best card when opponent leaves; cowards live longer.

4
00:00:33,644 --> 00:00:37,812
The Oath-Breaker, Cancel Promise or Alliance; words are wind, paper burns.

5
00:00:38,291 --> 00:00:41,726
False Friend, tell them you love them, discard their highest card.

6
00:00:42,985 --> 00:00:47,086
Properly Paranoid, Check bottom card; universe actually out to get you.

7
00:00:47,566 --> 00:00:52,427
Spies Are Despicable, Worst possible order; hate spies for lying, pay for truth.

8
00:00:52,807 --> 00:00:57,629
Who made the coffee? Betrayal Insurance, steal two items; poisoned your coffee three weeks ago.

9
00:00:58,049 --> 00:01:02,535
Chronic Backstabbing Disorder, must betray ally. Like sneezing, but with more knives.

10
00:01:02,555 --> 00:01:07,682
The Starscream, challenge leader, if you lose, apologize; grovel to face, plot against back.

11
00:01:07,702 --> 00:01:11,647
The Yes-Man, Copy action, do it worse; agree with what you said yesterday.

12
00:01:11,667 --> 00:01:15,911
Stealing the Credit, take card someone else played; it's yours now. I made this.

13
00:01:15,931 --> 00:01:20,744
Bastard Understudy, Eliminated player, take seat and hand; break a leg, crowbar.

14
00:01:21,646 --> 00:01:26,713
The Coup, Overthrow player with most points; Captain now, until lemurs get hungry.

15
00:01:26,733 --> 00:01:30,542
The Puppet Master, force another player's move; dance, little fly.

16
00:01:30,562 --> 00:01:35,558
I Can Rule Alone, break alliance, take shared resources; lose turn, you are now lonely.

17
00:01:35,699 --> 00:01:40,170
Board to Death, Meeting: everyone gives card; email? But then I can't eat you.

18
00:01:41,252 --> 00:01:44,821
The Mole, Peek at everyone's hand; digging for dirt, not worms.

19
00:01:44,841 --> 00:01:49,699
Whose side, partner? Double Agent, Play on someone else's turn; their move, your target; mostly my side.

20
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:53,952
The Stool Pigeon, Name card, opponent discards; sing like a bird for a plea deal.

21
00:01:53,972 --> 00:01:59,085
Dead Person Impersonation, retrieve graveyard card; death exaggerated to collect insurance money.

22
00:01:59,486 --> 00:02:04,702
Family hour. Betrayal by Offspring, bad card to parent; thanks for food, Mom. Now get out of my kingdom.

23
00:02:05,143 --> 00:02:08,979
Parental Betrayal, sacrifice lower card for higher; I can take you out for a snack.

24
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:14,225
Not Actually His Child, reveal secret, swap hand with deck; he has your eyes, but the milkman's beak.

25
00:02:14,466 --> 00:02:17,898
Kinslaying, Same faction eliminated; evil saves on holiday gifts.

26
00:02:18,099 --> 00:02:22,204
Love-Interest Traitor, Opponent helps, steal points; working for the Empire all along.

27
00:02:22,344 --> 00:02:26,457
The Honey Trap, force attack, reflect damage; not love, bioluminescent predatory bait.

28
00:02:26,477 --> 00:02:30,472
Fair-Weather Friend, Abandon ally for points; with you until slightly inconvenient.

29
00:02:30,492 --> 00:02:34,658
Mistaken for Betrayal, looks like attack, actually heals; why hit me with a newspaper?

30
00:02:34,959 --> 00:02:39,250
Boo me! Face-Heel Turn? Good to Evil, healing into damage; chew furniture.

31
00:02:39,270 --> 00:02:40,402
Thirty: blank. Sign here.

32
00:02:40,422 --> 00:02:44,156
Going Native, Adopt ability of player to left; the shrimp is better here.

33
00:02:44,276 --> 00:02:48,420
The Quisling, Help opponent against own team; welcome our new insect-eating overlords.

34
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:52,456
Trojan Horse, Gift card, opponent loses cards; Greeks bearing gifts, wooden Cats.

35
00:02:52,476 --> 00:02:56,228
Lured Into a Trap, High-value card face down; looked delicious, snapped spine.

36
00:02:56,369 --> 00:02:59,806
False Innocence Trick, Negate accusation; who, me? Just a lil' guy.

37
00:02:59,947 --> 00:03:03,508
Nasty Party, Lowest roll executed; Red Wedding catering: exquisite.

38
00:03:03,829 --> 00:03:08,122
Partner? Silent. Prisoner's Dilemma, Snitch or Silent; if we both talk, we cook.

39
00:03:08,303 --> 00:03:12,885
I Surrender, Suckers! Cancel combat, then double damage; white flag? Just a napkin.

40
00:03:13,066 --> 00:03:16,893
Rash Equilibrium, No attacks until next turn; stand here and die of thirst.

41
00:03:17,014 --> 00:03:21,131
The Gambit, sacrifice best card to win; lost battle to win war. And parking space.

42
00:03:21,151 --> 00:03:25,675
Thirty Pieces of Silver, sell out ally; loyalty surprisingly affordable in this economy.

43
00:03:25,695 --> 00:03:30,108
Second coffee? Poisoned Chalice, Offer card, accept and die; toast to health, or lack thereof.

44
00:03:30,128 --> 00:03:35,354
Trust me, bro. Lying Finger Cross, cancel deal; doesn't count if digits are intertwined. International law.

45
00:03:35,374 --> 00:03:38,969
Burner Phone, Secret contact, swap cards; new number, already gone.

46
00:03:38,989 --> 00:03:43,819
The Scapegoat, Transfer damage to another player; guy with horns! Wait, I have horns.

47
00:03:43,839 --> 00:03:47,491
Cannon Fodder, Discard Minion to block; bravery matched by expendability.

48
00:03:47,511 --> 00:03:51,490
Shoot the Messenger, Discard card from their hand; bad news is a capital offense.

49
00:03:51,510 --> 00:03:56,190
You Have Outlived Your Usefulness. Eliminate own ally; job is done, and so are you.

50
00:03:56,210 --> 00:04:00,155
Sixth Ranger Traitor, Join team, betray immediately; evil since opening credits.

51
00:04:00,175 --> 00:04:04,650
Evil All Along, true form, new hand; I wasn't shy, I was cocooning my rage.

52
00:04:05,013 --> 00:04:08,784
Manchurian Candidate, activate Sleeper. When you hear Omelette, kill the Prime Minister.

53
00:04:09,004 --> 00:04:12,978
The Corruptible, offered card, join their team; I have morals, but I really like mud.

54
00:04:13,260 --> 00:04:18,992
You too, partner? Et Tu, Brute? Best friend attacks, instantly wins; you die of heartbreak. Then fall, Fido.

55
00:04:19,233 --> 00:04:23,266
The Vendetta, Target player who hurt you five turns ago; elephants never forget.

56
00:04:23,367 --> 00:04:28,480
My shoes! Curse Your Sudden but Inevitable Betrayal! Betrayed? Shout title, steal shoes.

57
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:33,854
Thirty, filled in: Regretful Traitor, Sacrifice yourself to save another; I won, at what cost?

58
00:04:34,859 --> 00:04:41,672
Shoes gone. Soul kept. Chair: foam. Still partners. Stay Fluffy!

59
00:04:49,663 --> 00:04:51,041
Stay Fluffy!
